WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.491 line:73%
Bakit hindi umaabot sa
rated watts ang panels mo?

c02
00:00:03.841 --> 00:00:06.611 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.961 --> 00:00:11.171 line:73%
Ang rating ay galing sa lab
test: standard test conditions.

c04
00:00:11.271 --> 00:00:17.601 line:73%
1000 W/m² na liwanag at
25°C na cell temperature.

c05
00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:21.081 line:73%
Sa totoong bubong,
mas mainit ang panels,

c06
00:00:21.131 --> 00:00:24.521 line:73%
at kapag mas mainit,
bumababa ang output.

c07
00:00:24.821 --> 00:00:28.851 line:73%
May epekto rin ang anino,
alikabok, at anggulo ng araw.

c08
00:00:29.151 --> 00:00:32.501 line:73%
Kaya normal na mas mababa
ang aktwal kaysa rating.

cz1
00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:38.071 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:38.421 --> 00:00:40.881 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
